            "body": "> So jumping to the next closest side of ` textobject instead of being able to precisely choose which side exactly seems like the right fit for me.\n\nSorry, I still don't understand. Could you please give a concrete example of how you would like `` [` `` and `` ]` `` to behave? Right now my understanding is that they should behave like \"jump to the right side of the previous `` ` `` textobject\" and \"jump to the left side of the next `` ` `` textobject\". The \"closest side\" for these cases is known in advance when creating a mapping.",
